'''Hot and Cold''' is a set of two islands located in the [[Second Sea]].

==Appearance== 
Hot and Cold is located to the south of the [[Green Zone]], being a pair of tomoe (comma) shaped islands, which, when put together, form a Taijitu (yin-yang) circle. It has a small river separating the islands. As the name suggests, one of the islands is cold, and the other is hot. 

The cold side (left part of the image) resembles an icy tundra with pale and blue colors, being mainly covered in snow and ice. In the center lies a large layered [[laboratory]] with a glass globe on top of it, with multiple events being able to be hosted inside it. The laboratory features small extensions on either side, as well as a tall extension on the pointy tip of the island. The island also has a small village on the right.

The hot side (right part of the image) is a hellscape-like area, with lava seeping on it. The elevated center hosts the [[Smoke Admiral]], inside a black cathedral with red stained glass windows, surrounded by a pool of [[lava]] and curved spires. The cathedral also has a crypt that can be accessed from a slightly opened door in behind, where players can buy [[Order]] raid chips from [[Arlthmetic]]. A volcano is located on the left and right side of cathedral. The left volcano and a hill are connected by a metal arch and the hill has a lava bucket. There's also another hill in between the arch, which leads to a hidden room for hosting [[Order]] raids and purchasing the [[Cyborg]] [[race]]. There's a large village in the right side of cathedral near the right volcano, with two sectors that are separated by an arch made by elevated center. The front side of the village is inhabiting the [[First Sea]]'s [[fighting style]] [[NPCs]].

