==Laboratory==
Upon entering the Laboratory, players will encounter four large panels. Clicking on one of the panels will cause the screen's color to change. Arranging the panels in the sequence of '''{{Color|red|Red}}''', '''{{Color|blue|Blue}}''', '''{{Color|lime|Green}}''', and '''{{Color|blue|Blue}}''' <big>(🟥🟦🟩🟦)</big> will open a door behind the panels which will lead to the raid room following a steep passage where the players can join or host a raid. (The player cannot transform or hold anything in order to press the button). Additionally, upon entering the room, the player can collect 2 golden chests and 1 silver chest.

==Trivia==
* Although the [[Smoke Admiral]]'s quest giver is on the cold side, his boss room is on the hot side.
* The [[Barista Cousin]] has a chance of spawning next to the of the [[Smoke Admiral]]'s Castle.
* There is a glitch where if the player spawns a [[Boat]] larger than the [[Brigade]] at the Ice Island's [[Boat Dealer]]/[[Luxury Boat Dealer]] spawn, the boat will get stuck.
* The hot side of Hot and Cold is very infamous for allowing players with the [[Portal]] [[fruit]] be able to teleport to the [[lava]].
* There is a small area on the bucket of pouring lava on the Hot side of Hot and Cold where the lava will not harm the player.
* Hot and Cold is known to be annoying to grind in, due to all the enemies being spaced apart (especially the [[Magma Ninja]]s) dealing high damage, and having lengthy [[stun]]s.
* There is an unused room with a [[Chests|Golden Chest]] where you can only [[Flash Step|flashstep]] inside near the [[Horned Warrior|Horned Warriors]].

